## Period Framework — CYTD / LTM / LFY

Both the analytics page (`/dashboard/analytics`) and the dashboard (`/dashboard`) use identical toggle labels and identical period logic. There is no QUARTER toggle. There is no All Time toggle.

| Toggle | Current period | Comparison period | Sufficiency |
|--------|---------------|-------------------|-------------|
| CYTD | Jan 1 current year → last complete month | Jan 1 prior year → same month end prior year | ≥1 complete month current year AND same months complete in prior year |
| LTM | Last 12 complete months | 12 months before that (PLTM) | All 24 months complete |
| LFY | Last full calendar year | Calendar year before that | All 24 months complete |

**Default on load:** CYTD if available → LTM → LFY → locked state with LTM progress indicator.

**CYTD period boundaries (TypeScript pattern):**
```ts
// Current period
const period_start = startOfYear(new Date())           // Jan 1 current year
const period_end   = endOfMonth(lastCompleteMonth)     // from property_coverage_months

// Comparison period
const comp_start   = startOfYear(subYears(new Date(), 1))  // Jan 1 prior year
const comp_end     = subYears(period_end, 1)               // same month end, prior year
```

**YoY delta rule (dashboard cards):** Always compare current period to the same period prior year,
regardless of which toggle is selected. Delta is hidden (not shown as zero) if prior year data is incomplete.

