## AirDNA Monthly Refresh

Run after prior month closes. Never re-pull historical years.
```bash
npx ts-node scripts/ingest-airdna.ts --mode refresh --market 30a
```
`entire_place` filter is the default. Pass `--no-filter` for diagnostic use only.

